WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }
::cue(c.colora8c7fa) { color: #a8c7fa; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:03.620
Destroy Navy HQ!

3
00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:13.860
Stay out of my line of fire.

4
00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:20.330
Here he comes again!

5
00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:27.210
Ice Ball!

6
00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:45.860
– He froze Whitebeard!
– You did it!

7
00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:58.500
Oh, my...

8
00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:02.040
Looks like I can't freeze a quake man...

9
00:01:03.170 --> 00:01:04.210
Ice...

10
00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:10.720
Admiral Kuzan!

11
00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:14.190
– He stabbed him with Haki!
– Is Aokiji dead?!

12
00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:23.560
No! Don't be ridiculous.

13
00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:31.100
Ice Block: Partisan!

14
00:01:51.430 --> 00:01:53.210
Pops, get going!

15
00:01:53.210 --> 00:01:55.130
I'm counting on you.

16
00:02:00.530 --> 00:02:03.060
Diamond Jozu...

17
00:02:11.630 --> 00:02:13.850
We're almost there!

18
00:02:17.810 --> 00:02:19.550
I can see the execution platform!

19
00:02:19.550 --> 00:02:22.320
We've just gotta break through in the confusion!

20
00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:24.100
I won't let you!

21
00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:27.190
You're all gonna die here!

22
00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:39.710
A-Ace...

23
00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:29.070
<b>Oris Plaza</b>

24
00:05:30.610 --> 00:05:32.640
Straw Hat Luffy...

25
00:05:32.640 --> 00:05:38.450
I, Momonga, stake my pride as a
 Navy vice admiral on stopping you right here!

26
00:05:38.450 --> 00:05:41.850
Vice admiral... So you're the same as Grandpa, huh?

27
00:05:41.850 --> 00:05:42.860
Shave!

28
00:05:44.090 --> 00:05:45.090
Moon Walk!

29
00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:56.130
Gear...!

30
00:05:57.240 --> 00:05:58.940
Secon...

31
00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:01.670
Looks like you're out of energy!

32
00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:03.010
Finger Pistol!

33
00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:34.070
Garp. Consider your position!

34
00:06:58.330 --> 00:07:01.500
You gotta have more than just courage...

35
00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:03.880
Straw Hat Luffy,

36
00:07:03.880 --> 00:07:10.510
without enough strength,
 you can't save anyone, no matter how hard you try.

37
00:07:14.900 --> 00:07:17.320
A-Ace...

38
00:07:21.550 --> 00:07:24.890
– Kill Whitebeard!
 – We won't let you!

39
00:07:26.990 --> 00:07:29.630
Now will you please just disappear?

40
00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:39.540
Ace's little brother!

41
00:07:40.280 --> 00:07:42.240
Ace...

42
00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:54.090
Oh. Whitebeard's command has been dulled...

43
00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:57.560
To think that a man like you...

44
00:07:57.560 --> 00:08:02.090
would let such reckless trash...

45
00:08:02.090 --> 00:08:05.800
lead your attack.

46
00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:11.970
We won't let you touch Pops!

47
00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:14.930
Oh, how admirable...

48
00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:17.740
There he is! It's Straw Hat-boy!

49
00:08:17.740 --> 00:08:19.950
There he is, Jinbe!

50
00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:21.890
Who's that?!

51
00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:23.550
Where's that voice coming from?

52
00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:28.400
Don't you see me?!

53
00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:31.030
I'm Ivankov, dammit!

54
00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:33.150
Up there!

55
00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:35.520
What's with the size of his face?!

56
00:08:35.520 --> 00:08:37.360
It's Ivankov, from the Revolutionary Army!

57
00:08:37.360 --> 00:08:38.300
Luffy-kun!

58
00:08:38.300 --> 00:08:41.070
Are you still alive, Straw Hat-boy?!

59
00:08:41.070 --> 00:08:43.200
I'm... I'm...

60
00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:45.740
not falling!

61
00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:49.140
He fell!

62
00:08:50.940 --> 00:08:52.860
What are you doing?!

63
00:08:52.860 --> 00:08:54.080
I'm sorry...

64
00:08:55.390 --> 00:08:58.280
What a noisy guy.

65
00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:02.650
Iva-chan... Jinbe...

66
00:09:02.650 --> 00:09:06.190
Let me go, old man!

67
00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:09.400
I'm... I'm... Let me go!

68
00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:12.840
He's done more than enough. Treat his wounds.

69
00:09:12.840 --> 00:09:13.770
Yessir!

70
00:09:13.770 --> 00:09:15.950
I don't need that! There's no time!

71
00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:19.100
I've gotta go save him! Don't get in my way!

72
00:09:19.100 --> 00:09:22.010
Ace is... Ace is...

73
00:09:22.010 --> 00:09:23.310
Ace is...!

74
00:09:23.440 --> 00:09:28.450
Ace is my only brother in the world!

75
00:09:28.450 --> 00:09:29.590
I'll...

76
00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:31.480
I'll definitely...

77
00:09:31.480 --> 00:09:32.940
definitely...

78
00:09:34.290 --> 00:09:36.120
save him!

79
00:09:43.360 --> 00:09:45.100
Luffy-kun! Hey!

80
00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:46.560
This is awful...

81
00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:50.570
Please, Doctor!
 Do whatever you can to keep him alive!

82
00:09:50.800 --> 00:09:53.020
Luffy-kun! Luffy-kun!

83
00:09:53.020 --> 00:09:54.840
Hang in there, Luffy-kun!

84
00:09:56.260 --> 00:09:59.710
A bundle of spirit, who only knows how to talk big...

85
00:09:59.710 --> 00:10:02.230
Young and clumsy...

86
00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:09.750
I like fools like that...

87
00:10:15.270 --> 00:10:19.000
Those with no regard for their lives, advance!

88
00:10:22.330 --> 00:10:24.040
Here he comes! It's Whitebeard!

89
00:10:36.210 --> 00:10:39.680
If we just let you run wild as you please...

90
00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:41.650
the island won't be able to take it!

91
00:10:44.360 --> 00:10:47.230
Then try to protect it!

92
00:10:47.230 --> 00:10:49.670
Take care of Luffy-kun for me.

93
00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:51.730
Jinbe, what about you?

94
00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:55.700
I've chosen this as the place where I die!

95
00:11:21.250 --> 00:11:24.730
We've gotta clear a path for Pops!

96
00:11:24.730 --> 00:11:28.450
These are swordsmen as well... However...

97
00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:31.170
Such pitiful weaklings!

98
00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:33.210
Move!

99
00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:40.840
Clear a path!

100
00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:45.660
I must go to where Luffy is!

101
00:11:45.660 --> 00:11:47.120
Do not interfere!

102
00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:48.550
This is awful!

103
00:11:48.550 --> 00:11:52.020
Boa Hancock has started attacking indiscriminately again!

104
00:11:59.540 --> 00:12:01.570
Slave Arrow!

105
00:12:10.900 --> 00:12:13.550
The corpses keep piling up!

106
00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:32.660
I won't let you get in Pops' way!

107
00:12:34.780 --> 00:12:38.040
I don't think I'm very tasty, actually...

108
00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:44.410
I-I'm not done... Not yet...

109
00:12:45.770 --> 00:12:48.250
Push them back!

110
00:12:48.250 --> 00:12:50.150
That's...

111
00:12:50.150 --> 00:12:53.220
The pirates' allies from the shore!

112
00:12:53.220 --> 00:12:54.530
Sorry for the wait!

113
00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:57.090
Yeah, we've been waiting for you!

114
00:12:57.090 --> 00:13:00.960
Dammit! We let far too many of them get into the plaza!

115
00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:03.230
Uncle will yell at me!

116
00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:07.830
Under the circumstances,
 some casualties will be inevitable,

117
00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:11.460
but try to avoid hitting our own allies.

118
00:13:11.460 --> 00:13:13.240
Pacifista!

119
00:13:23.680 --> 00:13:25.920
Wait for me, Ace!

120
00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:33.390
He's flying!

121
00:13:33.390 --> 00:13:35.690
What are you doing?! Shoot him down!

122
00:13:38.530 --> 00:13:40.800
Our guns won't work!

123
00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:43.670
I don't care! Keep shooting!

124
00:13:56.620 --> 00:13:58.450
Commander Marco!

125
00:14:09.840 --> 00:14:13.180
Nobody told you to jump in on your own!

126
00:14:13.930 --> 00:14:17.300
The Hero, Monkey D. Garp!

127
00:14:17.300 --> 00:14:20.950
The legendary marine has finally made his move!

128
00:14:21.680 --> 00:14:23.650
Vice Admiral Garp!

129
00:14:26.310 --> 00:14:28.390
The vice admiral's in!

130
00:14:28.390 --> 00:14:30.350
He's the best guardian we have!

131
00:14:30.990 --> 00:14:32.820
Gramps...

132
00:14:33.740 --> 00:14:35.590
Garp...

133
00:14:35.590 --> 00:14:41.190
If you want to get past me, you'll have to kill me!

134
00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:43.870
Dumb kids...
